# Exercise catalog updates

When analyzing or expanding `backend/src/data/exercises.json`:

- **Never add** movements whose name includes **Landmine** or **Vitruvian** (skip those variants from external sources like MuscleWiki).
- Match existing schema: `id`, `name`, `primaryMuscle`, `secondaryMuscles`, `equipment`, `category`, `movementType`, `difficulty`, `instructions`, `tips`.
- Prefer equipment-specific names (e.g. `Dumbbell Thruster` over a generic `Thruster`).
- Keep `id` stable when renaming an existing movement so saved workouts still resolve.
